@page "/Account/Lockout"

<PageTitle>Locked out</PageTitle>

<div class="row" style="margin-top:10vh">
    <div class="col-8 col-md-4 offset-md-4">
        <header>
            <h1 class="text-danger">Locked out</h1>
        </header>
        <p class="text-danger">
            Too many failed sign-in attempts, so this account is temporarily locked.
        </p>
        <p>
            The lock clears itself after <strong>5 minutes</strong> - wait, then
            <a href="Account/Login">try again</a>. There is no password-reset e-mail in this
            application, so nothing else is needed.
        </p>
        <p>
            If the password is genuinely lost, an administrator with access to the host can delete the
            identity database (<code>db/app.db</code>, or the <code>APP_DB_PATH</code> volume) and
            restart the container: the default account is then re-created from the
            <code>DefaultUsers</code> configuration.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
